<title>USA: Richmond County, Ga., $72.5 mln water revs priced.</title>
<headline>Richmond County, Ga., $72.5 mln water revs priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Company said Monday it tentatively priced $72 million of Richmond County, Ga., water and sewerage revenue bonds, with a top tax-exempt yield of 5.518 percent in 2028.</p>
<p>The bonds are FGIC insured.</p>
